<PageShell
  title="Custom / in-house PIM mapping - ULC specification"
  description="Field-by-field mapping patterns from a custom or in-house product-master database to a ULC record. Identity, category, dimensional, scenario expansion, asset hashing, attestation mapping; cross-link to the full upstream guide."
